OL,3,GNEWSARise in memorials offering 'that
OL,4,Apersonal send-off'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Trevor Davis died in 2025, close
OL,7,Ffriend Pat Brady wanted his funeral to
OL,8,Fbe different.
OL,10,FThe 81-year-old had lived in both
OL,11,FNewcastle and Leeds and had "a really
OL,12,Fgood life and we needed to bring that
OL,13,Fout", she said.
OL,15,F"We had smiling pallbearers wearing odd
OL,16,Fsocks; we had a plastic blown-up parrot
OL,17,Fsitting on top of a coffin and a grumpy
OL,18,Fold Yorkshireman with his Leeds United
OL,19,Fcolours."
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
