OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSARise in memorials offering 'that
OL,4,Apersonal send-off'
OL,5,
OL,6,FResearch commissioned by the Society of
OL,7,FAllied and Independent Funeral
OL,8,FDirectors (SAIF) has found many people
OL,9,Fare choosing a more bespoke memorial
OL,10,Fservice, with 72% saying they think
OL,11,Ffunerals should reflect the
OL,12,Findividuality of the deceased.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
